          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty says: \"I will save my people from the countries of the east and the west.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will bring them back to live in Jerusalem; they will be my people, and I will be faithful and righteous to them as their God.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty says: \"Now hear these words, 'Let your hands be strong so that the temple may be built.' This is also what the prophets said who were present when the foundation was laid for the house of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Before that time there were no wages for people or hire for animals. No one could go about their business safely because of their enemies, since I had turned everyone against their neighbor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But now I will not deal with the remnant of this people as I did in the past,\" declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The seed will grow well, the vine will yield its fruit, the ground will produce its crops, and the heavens will drop their dew. I will give all these things as an inheritance to the remnant of this people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Just as you, Judah and Israel, have been a curse",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "among the nations, so I will save you, and you will be a blessing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not be afraid, but let your hands be strong.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty says: \"Just as I had determined to bring disaster on you and showed no pity when your ancestors angered me,\" says the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"so now I have determined to do good again to Jerusalem and Judah. Do not be afraid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the things you are to do: Speak the truth to each other, and render true and sound judgment in your courts;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "do not plot evil against each other, and do not love to swear falsely. I hate all this,\" declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
